        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_quantity = 150\n    final_quantity = 200\n    initial_price = 5\n    final_price = 4\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    midpoint_quantity = (initial_quantity + final_quantity) / 2\n    midpoint_price = (initial_price + final_price) / 2\n\n    percent_change_in_quantity = (\n        final_quantity - initial_quantity\n    ) / midpoint_quantity\n    percent_change_in_price = (\n        final_price - initial_price\n    ) / midpoint_price\n\n    arc_elasticity = percent_change_in_quantity / percent_change_in_price\n    answer = round(arc_elasticity, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
